232100Z POSITION NEAR 5.7S 47.3E.
23OCT26. TROPICAL CYCLONE 02S (AGUEDA), LOCATED APPROXIMATELY 505
NM EAST OF DAR ES SALAAM, TANZANIA, HAS TRACKED WESTWARD AT 10
KNOTS OVER THE PAST SIX HOURS. THE SATELLITE PRESENTATION HAS
DETERIORATED OVER THE PAST 12 HOURS AS THE SYSTEM HAS BEEN UNABLE
TO SUSTAIN SPORADIC BURSTS OF CONVECTION. THE LOW-LEVEL
CIRCULATION CENTER WAS CAPTURED BY A 231720Z METOP-B ASCAT PASS
WHICH CONFIRMED WIND SPEEDS OF 25-30 KTS AROUND THE CENTER. MODEL
GUIDANCE IS IN VERY GOOD AGREEMENT ABOUT THE WESTWARD TRAJECTORY
AND CONTINUED DECAY OF TC 02S IN AN UNFAVORABLE ENVIRONMENT OVER
THE NEXT 12 HOURS. THIS IS THE FINAL WARNING ON THIS SYSTEM BY
THE JOINT TYPHOON WRNCEN PEARL HARBOR HI. THE SYSTEM WILL BE
CLOSELY MONITORED FOR SIGNS OF REGENERATION. MINIMUM CENTRAL
PRESSURE AT 231800Z IS 1009 MB. MAXIMUM SIGNIFICANT WAVE HEIGHT
AT 231800Z IS 12 FEET.//
